## Result

The request had no antecedent, so I audited the orchestration surface and resolved it: **"the routing change" is the Agent Teams roster redirect — pointing the `mpd-tool-agent-team` row's `freshProvider` at `mpd-roster`** so an official `spawn_teammate` teammate follows its `teamModels` slot route. It is half-landed: the bundle patch declares it, the install path drops it.

### Audit finding (three writers, two answers)

| Writer | Value |
|---|---|
| bundle patch `cordis.patch.yml:654` | `freshProvider: mpd-roster` |
| legacy installer `scripts/install-profile.ts:450` | `freshProvider: "spawn"` |
| live `$DSH_HOME/cordis.patch.yml:585` (installer output) | `freshProvider: "spawn"` |
| **live resolution** `dsh --profile mpd-headless --dump-config` | **`freshProvider: spawn`** |

So on every `install-profile` install (including the ~15 QA lanes that install via the same script), the roster provider is mounted and never selected — teammates silently inherit the Lead's route, contradicting `AGENTS.md` §13, `CHANGELOG.md:332`, and `packages/mpd-bundle/README.md:14`. Upstream source confirms the switch is operative: `agent-team/lib/index.js:573-575` forwards `provider` to `startContinuable`, and `mpd-roster-provider-plugin/src/index.ts` applies the slot route. The standing `verify:rows` gate compares row **ids only**, so this config drift stayed green. (T-93 "routing" was ruled out: already landed in the retired, unmounted `mpd-agent-teams-plugin`.)

### Implemented (verified, in the writable root)

`routing-change.patch` — a unified diff for `scripts/install-profile.ts`:
1. row config `freshProvider: "mpd-roster"` (the routing change);
2. the self-test pin flipped to match;
3. a cross-writer drift guard that reads the value out of `cordis.patch.yml` and fails on divergence.

Verification (all reproduced, logged in `evidence/`):
- baseline dry-run emits `"spawn"`; patched dry-run emits `"mpd-roster"`; patched self-test passes;
- patch round-trips (`patch -p1 --dry-run` + apply) on a fresh copy;
- **end-to-end**: sandbox `DSH_HOME` with the patched row → `dsh --dump-config` resolves `freshProvider: mpd-roster` (vs `spawn` live);
- two negative controls redden with exit 1 (stale row config; patch/installer drift).

### Blocker (honest)

The change is **not in the bundle**: the bundle is read-only for this session (`touch … → Permission denied`, logged in `evidence/write-probe.txt`). To land it: apply the patch at the bundle root and re-run `scripts/install-profile.ts`, then `--dump-config` should show `mpd-roster`.

Off-mode discipline held: `team.gate=off`, no notice, and `.mpd/team/staging/` / `.mpd/team/teams/` do not exist — no team was staged or approved.

